  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "✨Introducing Grace and Peace Cottage<br>Private Pool | Bikes | Easy Beach Access | Sleeps 20 <br><br>Meet your new favorite 30A escape—two homes in one, made for gathering! With a private downstairs suite and a separate upstairs retreat, you can rent both for the ultimate beach getaway. Just steps from beach access and a breezy bike ride to the best bites in Old Seagrove, this 6-bedroom stunner sleeps 20 and comes with 8 bikes for cruising in style. Double the space, double the fun—your 30A vacation starts here!<br><br>Features to love ~ <br>- Prime location - 3 min walk to the beach! <br>- Private heated pool - enjoy the pool right outside your back patio.<br>- 8 adult bikes to cruise the Timphoochee Trail. <br>- Game night! Challenge your crew to a game of ping pong or foosball🏓<br>- Open concept oversized living with brand new decor and furniture <br>- Outdoor space with grills, lounge seating, and overlooks pool <br>- All bedrooms feel like a luxury retreat - oversized with their own ensuites. <br><br>🏖️Where you will be staying ~ Welcome to Seagrove!<br>- Around the corner from local favorites, Cafe ThirtyA and The Perfect Pig. Must check out: Old Florida Fish House (come at twilight hour for the best ambiance!) and Seagrove Village Market. <br>- 3 min walk to Seagrove Beach Access <br>- 5 mins to Seaside's Central Square. Great spot for restaurants, shopping, and more. Don't miss out on Pickles. 🥒<br>- Less than 15 min to Rosemary and Alys Beach <br><br>✨Step Inside - Peace Cottage (Upper Level) <br>- As you enter, you're greeted with the primary king bedroom. It has everything you need for a peaceful getaway. With a spa-like ensuite bathroom featuring a jetted tub, walk-in shower, and dual sinks, you may never leave! It even has a crib for the littlest of family members to sleep in peace.<br>- Next to the primary bedroom, also in the hall, is the laundry closet with full size washer and dryer.<br>- Sweet dreams await in the next guest bedroom - this room features two Queen beds with cozy coastal decor. This room also features an ensuite shared bathroom with a walk-in shower.<br>- Next up down the hall is the King bedroom featuring a private ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower.<br>- Peek-a-boo! Kids will love these Twin over Twin bunkbeds (and truly the best hiding spot!) <br>- The coastal designed living area will be THE place to be on your vacation. The open concept has a spot for everyone in the family to enjoy each other's company, listen to the record player, or gather for ultimate ping-pong tournaments.<br>- Coffee lovers rejoice! Not only does the fully stocked kitchen have everything you need to enjoy meals in, but it also comes with 3 different coffee machine options to perfect your latte art! Sip on it with the additional seating right off the kitchen counter. Did we mention coffee is on us?<br>- Gather round! The dining table seats 10, plus we offer a highchair as well. <br>- Step outside to the balcony and soak in the salty air or fire up the grill! The outdoor space also gives you peek-a-boo gulf views. 🌊<br><br>💤For Rest (Sleeps 10)<br>- King bedroom with private ensuite<br>- Two Queen beds with shared ensuite<br>- King Bedroom with private ensuite<br>- Twin over Twin bunk bed in hallway nook<br><br>✨Step Inside - Grace Cottage (Lower level) <br>- The primary king bedroom is truly your own personal getaway. Not only does it come with an ensuite bathroom with a Jacuzzi bathtub, dual sinks and walk in shower, but it also features a kitchenette. You'll love the vintage fridge and cozy-apartment vibes. <br>- Right next to the primary bedroom in the hall is the laundry closet with full size washer and dryer.<br>- Next up! The double Queen bedroom comes with an ensuite shared bathroom with a walk-in shower. <br>- Further down the hall is the King bedroom featuring a relaxing seating area and an ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower.<br>- Peek-a-boo! Kids will love these Twin over Twin bunkbeds (and truly the best hiding spot!) <br>- The open concept living area will not only be your favorite spot in this home, but it also has the space to entertain your entire family. Everyone can enjoy the coastal décor together or spend all night in foosball tournaments! Have the kids hang out in the kiddie corner with books and games for their entertainment!<br>- The fully stocked kitchen has everything you need to create memorable meals with ease. Generous counter space makes prep and gathering effortless, while four bar seats offer the perfect front-row view to watch the magic unfold.<br>- Let's make some memories. The dining table seats up to 8 people and there are 2 additional dining seats. <br>- Ready to take it outside? Right off the pool area is where you will find the outdoor seating area on the patio, which also features a brand-new grill for all your beach BBQ!<br>- The pool area also features outdoor dining with shade.<br><br>💤For Rest (Sleeps 10)<br>- King bedroom with private ensuite<br>- Two Queen beds with shared ensuite<br>- King Bedroom with private ensuite<br>- Twin over Twin bunk bed in hallway<br><br>The Big Picture: <br>- 6 separate rooms including a suite on the lower level - perfect for grandparents or couples who may need some extra privacy. <br>- In total, the home sleeps 20, and comes with all the baby friendly gear you'll need to make for an easy-breezy stay; pack n play, highchair, and baby bathtub in each home. <br><br>🤩 The Essentials ~ All Included in your Stay <br>- We provide a starter kit of everything you'll need to kick off your stay: paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, laundry pods, and more. <br>- The home has both a Keurig, an espresso machine, and a standard drip coffee maker, coffee's on us! Bonus: Peace Cottage also comes with an espresso maker. <br>- Premium full-size bath products in every bathroom/kitchen – We provide body wash, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, and hand soap.<br>- Beach Gear: We've got you covered - towels, chairs, and umbrella all provided. 8 beach chairs and 2 umbrellas combined! <br>- Full size washer and dryer in each home. <br><br>✏️Other things to note<br>- 2 cars will fit in the driveway for each cottage. 4 total spaces together.<br>- The word is out! 30A is one of Florida's best vacation spots. Unfortunately, more visitors means less parking options. Additional parking spaces are the responsibility of the renter. We recommend looking into nearby storage facilities that offer long-term parking options in their lots. <br>- The pool can be heated for $50/day.<br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- Apologies, no furry friends are allowed at the home. We appreciate your understanding on this.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters. <br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can answer any questions for you! 💛",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
